ia de Software</span><span class="text-blue-700 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-100/70 border border-blue-200">Cursando</span></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Bacharelado • Previsão 2028</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1"><span class="font-bold text-slate-900">Análise e Desenv. de Sistemas</span><span class="text-emerald-700 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100/70 border border-emerald-200">Concluído</span></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Graduação Tecnológica • FIAP</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono"><span>Foco: Arquitetura &amp; Cloud</span><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">∞ Aprendizado Contínuo</span></div></div><div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between"><div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-terminal w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19h8"></path><path d="m4 17 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Ponte Suporte &amp; Software</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">No suporte da BB Central, lido com Active Directory, redes e sistemas corporativos. Essa vivência me capacitou a criar automações em PowerShell e Bash e a entender como falhas afetam o usuário final.</p></div><div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-mono text-blue-600 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>&gt; Visão analítica de causa-raiz</span></div></div><div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between"><div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers lucide-layers-3 w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">APIs, Backend &amp; Dados</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Foco no desenvolvimento de microsserviços e APIs RESTful (.NET 8, Node.js e Python), com modelagem consistente em PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite e bancos em nuvem como Firestore.</p></div><div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-mono text-blue-600 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>&gt; Full Cycle 3.0 &amp; Ignite</span></div></div><div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between"><div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-teal-50 border border-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-600 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Trabalho em Equipe &amp; Facilitação</h3><p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Facilitador em equipes multidisciplinares da FIAP em desafios para Porto Seguro e Mottu. Focado em comunicação clara, suporte aos colegas e garantia de entregas no prazo.</p></div><div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 text-xs font-mono text-blue-600 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5"><span>&gt; Liderança &amp; Resolução</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id="experiencia" class="py-24 sm:py-32 relative border-t border-slate-200/80 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="flex flex-col items-start mb-14 sm:mb-16"><span class="section-kicker">03 / EXPERIÊNCIA PROFISSIONAL</span><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight">Vivência corporativa &amp; <span class="text-blue-600">engenharia prática</span></h2><p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Atuação com suporte corporativo, infraestrutura e desenvolvimento de scripts na BB Central, fortalecendo a transição sólida para a engenharia de software.</p></div><div class="bg-slate-50/80 p-7 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-3xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200/80"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-2"><span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Estagiário – Assistente Técnico</span><span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-800 border border-cyan-200 text-xs font-mono font-bold">Estágio Corporativo</span></div><p class="text-base font-bold text-blue-700 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBo